\\n56|\\n57|Deliver ongoing support\\n58|and maintenance services \\n59|\\n60|\\n61|4. Functional Requirements\\n62|4.1 Source Code Management (SCM)\\n63|The solution shall provide:\\n64|\\n65|Distributed version\\n66|control repositories \\n67|\\n68|Branching, merging, and\\n69|pull/merge request workflows \\n70|\\n71|Role-based access\\n72|control for repositories \\n73|\\n74|Web-based repository\\n75|management interface \\n76|\\n77|Full audit trail of code\\n78|changes \\n79|\\n80|\\n81|4.2 CI/CD Pipeline Management\\n82|The solution shall support:\\n83|\\n84|Declarative pipeline\\n85|definitions (e.g., YAML-based) \\n86|\\n87|Automated build, test,\\n88|and deployment workflows \\n89|\\n90|Event-based triggers\\n91|(code commits, schedules, API calls) \\n92|\\n93|Parallel and scalable\\n94|pipeline execution \\n95|\\n96|Artifact generation and\\n97|retention \\n98|\\n99|\\n100|4.3 Project and Work Management\\n101|The platform shall include:\\n102|\\n103|Issue and ticket\\n104|management system \\n105|\\n106|Agile boards (Scrum and\\n107|Kanban) \\n108|\\n109|Sprint and milestone\\n110|tracking \\n111|\\n112|Collaboration features\\n113|(comments, mentions, notifications) \\n114|\\n115|\\n116|4.4 Package and Artifact Repository\\n117|The solution shall provide:\\n118|\\n119|Support for multiple\\n120|package formats (containers, binaries, libraries) \\n121|\\n122|Version-controlled\\n123|artifact storage \\n124|\\n125|Dependency caching and\\n126|proxy capabilities \\n127|\\n128|\\n129|4.5 User and Access Management\\n130|The platform shall support:\\n131|\\n132|Role-Based Access\\n133|Control (RBAC) \\n134|\\n135|Integration with\\n136|enterprise identity systems (LDAP / Active Directory) \\n137|\\n138|Multi-project and\\n139|multi-team isolation \\n140|\\n141|Comprehensive audit\\n142|logging \\n143|\\n144|\\n145|5. Advanced DevOps Requirements\\n146|5.1 DevSecOps Capabilities\\n147|The solution shall include:\\n148|\\n149|Static code security\\n150|analysis \\n151|\\n152|Dynamic application\\n153|security testing \\n154|\\n155|Open-source dependency\\n156|vulnerability scanning \\n157|\\n158|Secret detection\\n159|mechanisms \\n160|\\n161|Container security\\n162|scanning \\n163|\\n164|\\n165|5.2 Infrastructure as Code (IaC)\\n166|The solution shall:\\n167|\\n168|Support infrastructure\\n169|provisioning through code \\n170|\\n171|Enable version control\\n172|of infrastructure definitions \\n173|\\n174|Integrate IaC into CI/CD\\n175|pipelines \\n176|\\n177|\\n178|5.3 Deployment and Environment Management\\n179|The platform shall provide:\\n180|\\n181|Multi-environment\\n182|lifecycle management (Dev, Test, UAT, Production) \\n183|\\n184|Deployment strategies\\n185|including: \\n186|\\n187|Blue/Green \\n188|\\n189|Canary \\n190|\\n191|Rolling deployments \\n192|\\n193|\\n194|Environment-specific\\n195|configuration control \\n196|\\n197|\\n198|5.4 Monitoring and Observability\\n199|The solution shall support:\\n200|\\n201|Pipeline monitoring and\\n202|execution tracking \\n203|\\n204|Integration with logging\\n205|and monitoring systems \\n206|\\n207|Alerting and\\n208|notification mechanisms \\n209|\\n210|Operational dashboards \\n211|\\n212|\\n213|5.5 API and Integration\\n214|The platform shall include:\\n215|\\n216|Comprehensive REST APIs \\n217|\\n218|Webhook support for\\n219|integrations \\n220|\\n221|Compatibility with\\n222|third-party tools and cloud services \\n223|\\n224|\\n225|6. Enterprise Requirements\\n226|6.1 Governance and Compliance\\n227|The solution shall provide:\\n228|\\n229|Policy enforcement for\\n230|pipelines and deployments \\n231|\\n232|Approval workflows and\\n233|release gates \\n234|\\n235|Compliance reporting and\\n236|audit trails \\n237|\\n238|\\n239|6.2 Analytics and Reporting\\n240|The platform shall include:\\n241|\\n242|DevOps performance\\n243|metrics (e.g., deployment frequency, lead time) \\n244|\\n245|Pipeline efficiency\\n246|analytics \\n247|\\n248|Team productivity\\n249|insights \\n250|\\n251|\\n252|6.3 High Availability and Scalability\\n253|The solution shall:\\n254|\\n255|Support clustered\\n256|deployment architecture \\n257|\\n258|Enable horizontal\\n259|scaling of workloads \\n260|\\n261|Provide load balancing\\n262|and failover mechanisms \\n263|\\n264|\\n265|6.4 Backup and Disaster Recovery\\n266|The platform shall include:\\n267|\\n268|Automated backup\\n269|capabilities \\n270|\\n271|Point-in-time recovery \\n272|\\n273|Disaster recovery\\n274|options across sites \\n275|\\n276|\\n277|6.5 AI-Driven Capabilities (Optional)\\n278|Vendors are encouraged to provide:\\n279|\\n280|AI-assisted code\\n281|analysis and recommendations \\n282|\\n283|Predictive pipeline\\n284|failure detection \\n285|\\n286|Intelligent automation\\n287|and optimization features \\n288|\\n289|\\n290|7. Deployment Requirements\\n291|\\n292|The solution must be\\n293|deployed on-premises at Roxy Data Center \\n294|\\n295|Support for private\\n296|cloud or hybrid architecture is preferred \\n297|\\n298|Must align with MOE\\n299|infrastructure standards (compute, storage, network) \\n300|\\n301|\\n302|8. Security Requirements\\n303|The solution must:\\n304|\\n305|Ensure encryption of\\n306|data in transit and at rest \\n307|\\n308|Support Single Sign-On\\n309|(SSO), OAuth, and SAML \\n310|\\n311|Provide fine-grained\\n312|access controls \\n313|\\n314|Maintain detailed audit\\n315|logs for all activities \\n316|\\n317|\\n318|9. Operational Requirements\\n319|\\n320|Web-based user interface\\n321|\\n322|CLI and API access \\n323|\\n324|Automated patching and\\n325|upgrade mechanisms \\n326|\\n327|Role-based dashboards\\n328|and views \\n329|\\n330|\\n331|10. Licensing Requirements\\n332|Vendors must provide:\\n333|\\n334|Flexible licensing model\\n335|based on: \\n336|\\n337|Number of users \\n338|\\n339|Compute/pipeline\\n340|capacity \\n341|\\n342|Storage usage \\n343|\\n344|\\n345|Tiered licensing options\\n346|(Core / Advanced / Enterprise) \\n347|\\n348|Clear definition of\\n349|included features per tier \\n350|\\n351|\\n352|11. Deliverables\\n353|The vendor shall deliver:\\n354|\\n355|Fully deployed DevOps\\n356|platform at Roxy Data Center \\n357|\\n358|Software licenses and\\n359|activation \\n360|\\n361|Configuration and\\n362|integration with MOE systems \\n363|\\n364|Technical documentation \\n365|\\n366|Training sessions for\\n367|MOE teams \\n368|\\n369|Support and maintenance\\n370|services'}
