 capabilities\\n4.5 User and Access Management\\n- Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\\n- Integration with enterprise identity systems (LDAP / Active Directory)\\n- Multi-project and multi-team isolation\\n- Comprehensive audit logging\\nAdvanced DevOps Requirements\\n5.1 DevSecOps Capabilities\\n- Static code security analysis\\n- Dynamic application security testing\\n- Open-source dependency vulnerability scanning\\n- Secret detection mechanisms\\n- Container security scanning\\n5.2 Infrastructure as Code (IaC)\\n- Support infrastructure provisioning through code\\n- Enable version control of infrastructure definitions\\n- Integrate IaC into CI/CD pipelines\\n5.3 Deployment and Environment Management\\n- Multi-environment lifecycle management (Dev, Test, UAT, Production)\\n- Deployment strategies including Blue/Green, Canary, Rolling deployments\\n- Environment-specific configuration control\\n5.4 Monitoring and Observability\\n- Pipeline monitoring and execution tracking\\n- Integration with logging and monitoring systems\\n- Alerting and notification mechanisms\\n- Operational dashboards\\n5.5 API and Integration\\n- Comprehensive REST APIs\\n- Webhook support for integrations\\n- Compatibility with third-party tools and cloud services\\nEnterprise Requirements\\n6.1 Governance and Compliance\\n- Policy enforcement for pipelines and deployments\\n- Approval workflows and release gates\\n- Compliance reporting and audit trails\\n6.2 Analytics and Reporting\\n- DevOps performance metrics (deployment frequency, lead time)\\n- Pipeline efficiency analytics\\n- Team productivity insights\\n6.3 High Availability and Scalability\\n- Support clustered deployment architecture\\n- Enable horizontal scaling of workloads\\n- Provide load balancing and failover mechanisms\\n6.4 Backup and Disaster Recovery\\n- Automated backup capabilities\\n- Point-in-time recovery\\n- Disaster recovery options across sites\\n6.5 AI-Driven Capabilities (Optional)\\n- AI-assisted code analysis and recommendations\\n- Predictive pipeline failure detection\\n- Intelligent automation and optimization features\\nDeployment Requirements\\nThe solution must be deployed on-premises at Roxy Data Center; support for private cloud or hybrid architecture is preferred; must align with MOE infrastructure standards.\\nSecurity Requirements\\nEnsure encryption of data in transit and at rest; support SSO, OAuth, and SAML; provide fine-grained access controls; maintain detailed audit logs.\\nOperational Requirements\\nWeb-based user interface; CLI and API access; automated patching and upgrade mechanisms; role-based dashboards and views.\\nLicensing Requirements\\nFlexible licensing model based on number of users, compute/pipeline capacity, storage usage; tiered options (Core/Advanced/Enterprise); clear definition of included features per tier.\\nDeliverables\\nFully deployed DevOps platform at Roxy Data Center; software licenses and activation; configuration and integration with MOE systems; technical documentation; training sessions for MOE teams; support and maintenance services.'''\n# Create PDF\npdf = FPDF()\npdf.set_auto_page_break(auto=True, margin=15)\n# Title page\npdf.add_page()\npdf.set_font('Arial', 'B', 16)\npdf.cell(0,10,'Proposal Response to RFP: DevOps Server License Module Implementation', ln=True, align='C')\npdf.ln(10)\npdf.set_font('Arial', '', 12)\npdf.multi_cell(0,6,content)\n# Save\noutput_path = r'C:\\Users\\Karim ElWaly\\Documents\\rfp.pdf'\nos.makedirs(os.path.dirname(output_path), exist_ok=True)\npdf.output(output_path)\nprint('PDF written to', output_path)\n"}
